    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/67fee6dfaa11239254bb086c85ab7765.poster.avif?t=1749344401\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/67fee6dfaa11239254bb086c85ab7765.webm?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/67fee6dfaa11239254bb086c85ab7765.mp4?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Young, dashing... dead.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bones, a small skeleton torn from his grave by a construction crane and swept into a storm drain, awakens in the depths of a sewer, lost, confused, and in pieces. Emerging into a strange, modern city full of unfamiliar technology and ghostly whispers, he must sneak past the living, solve puzzles, and deliver messages from the dead. Limb by limb, clue by clue, Bones begins to piece himself and his past back together in a journey of strange favors, quiet discoveries, and self-discovery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/4a66ca20e8326c487364bebcc589f002.poster.avif?t=1749344401\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/4a66ca20e8326c487364bebcc589f002.webm?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/4a66ca20e8326c487364bebcc589f002.mp4?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clue-Driven Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings, uncover hidden details, and interpret character dialogue to piece together forgotten memories and navigate your path forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stealth-Based Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise stealth as a core mechanic, navigating dangerous environments with quiet movements and calculated planning to outwit enemies or avoid detection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Message Delivery Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver critical messages, often via paper planes, that connect stories between characters and unlock deeper layers of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/85f061080c3c44fad4aa64e40987e8d8.poster.avif?t=1749344401\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/85f061080c3c44fad4aa64e40987e8d8.webm?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/85f061080c3c44fad4aa64e40987e8d8.mp4?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ability-Driven Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new abilities that open previously inaccessible areas, encouraging meaningful backtracking and rewarding curiosity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episodic Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story-rich, single-player adventure told across seven unique episodes filled with mystery and emotion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Worldbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky yet eerie visual style paired with an original score creates a distinctive, emotionally rich world full of character and mystery.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/3278a8933cdc849bda1879176d1e7d8a.poster.avif?t=1749344401\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/3278a8933cdc849bda1879176d1e7d8a.webm?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/3278a8933cdc849bda1879176d1e7d8a.mp4?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/67fee6dfaa11239254bb086c85ab7765.poster.avif?t=1749344401\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/67fee6dfaa11239254bb086c85ab7765.webm?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/67fee6dfaa11239254bb086c85ab7765.mp4?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Young, dashing... dead.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bones, a small skeleton torn from his grave by a construction crane and swept into a storm drain, awakens in the depths of a sewer, lost, confused, and in pieces. Emerging into a strange, modern city full of unfamiliar technology and ghostly whispers, he must sneak past the living, solve puzzles, and deliver messages from the dead. Limb by limb, clue by clue, Bones begins to piece himself and his past back together in a journey of strange favors, quiet discoveries, and self-discovery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/4a66ca20e8326c487364bebcc589f002.poster.avif?t=1749344401\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/4a66ca20e8326c487364bebcc589f002.webm?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/4a66ca20e8326c487364bebcc589f002.mp4?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clue-Driven Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings, uncover hidden details, and interpret character dialogue to piece together forgotten memories and navigate your path forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stealth-Based Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise stealth as a core mechanic, navigating dangerous environments with quiet movements and calculated planning to outwit enemies or avoid detection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Message Delivery Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver critical messages, often via paper planes, that connect stories between characters and unlock deeper layers of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/85f061080c3c44fad4aa64e40987e8d8.poster.avif?t=1749344401\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/85f061080c3c44fad4aa64e40987e8d8.webm?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/85f061080c3c44fad4aa64e40987e8d8.mp4?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ability-Driven Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new abilities that open previously inaccessible areas, encouraging meaningful backtracking and rewarding curiosity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episodic Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story-rich, single-player adventure told across seven unique episodes filled with mystery and emotion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Worldbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky yet eerie visual style paired with an original score creates a distinctive, emotionally rich world full of character and mystery.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/3278a8933cdc849bda1879176d1e7d8a.poster.avif?t=1749344401\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/3278a8933cdc849bda1879176d1e7d8a.webm?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718960/extras/3278a8933cdc849bda1879176d1e7d8a.mp4?t=1749344401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
